        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 2,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You catch up fast.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Perhaps it's time to give an explanation for your actions.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "What form of explanation would you like, Lord Zuo?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You roused demons to lay harm to the citizenry, seized the country's fortifications, and even plotted against the other proxies.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "text": "Given your actions, your crimes are far worse than Wang's.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I may have some objections to your charges, but what would you like to do here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Hand over the cloth, and return to the capital under Sui Regulator supervision.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And what will I get in return?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A chance at a fair trial.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shame that it is not a price I am willing to pay.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "You would make an enemy of Yan?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If I would, what could you possibly do?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
