    },
    {
        "text": "Zuo Le takes a step forward and unsheathes his blade."
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "focus": "n"
    },
    {
        "text": "Is it really so much fun to pick on mortals?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$e_skill_skulsrsword"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.2,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$sheildimpact"
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 0.5,
        "xstrength": 30,
        "ystrength": 30,
        "vibrato": 30,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_4121_zuole_1#6$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's you\u2014?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Zuo Le"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#1$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#1$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Not bad, kid. You managed to tail him all the way here. Gotta hand it to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "But this is a family matter. You Sui Regulator folks will have to give us some personal space.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "duration": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_imp_ancientsword_h"
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$p_atk_blade_n",
        "delay": 0.3,
        "channel": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0.8,
        "r": 1,
        "g": 1,
        "b": 1,
        "fadetime": 0.1,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "camerashake",
        "duration": 1.5,
        "xstrength": 10,
        "ystrength": 10,
        "vibrato": 60,
        "randomness": 90,
        "fadeout": true,
        "block": false
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1",
        "duration": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "You escaped the <i>heart.</i> You are moving faster than I anticipated. Seems my little sisters have grown up.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't talk like we're all getting along.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "What do you think this is, a test? And here I thought you were actually trying to off us.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#7$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't be ridiculous.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you've been laying low all these years to weave this cloth.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Making clothes out of Yan's <i>splendor</i> Not bad.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "He needs this before he goes to see It.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "Having travelled all around Yan, I thought it a shame when I finally decided to weave Dahuang into it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "So you two are in on this together\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "text": "And he's finished preparing already...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "I should've figured. You get along with the weiqi failure the best.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't act like you don't know what taking your cloth out of this place means.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "This is a straight-up declaration of war against Yan.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "And?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#7$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "You're Sange, my third brother. And truth be told, out of all my older siblings, you're one of the ones I like best. I always feel like the two of us crank out some pretty sick ideas.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Remember how I helped you sell fakes of Dusk's paintings that one time?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#6$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "You what?!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "But I'm sorry, this is way overdoing it, even for me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "A shame.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "From the looks of it, you're not on my side either, Dusk?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#3$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "r"
    },
    {
        "text": "In your dreams.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dusk"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's been a few centuries since we've had a family reunion with more than three of us. To think that the first thing we'd be doing is fighting among ourselves, just like all those years ago.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "text": "What's the deal? Reminiscing on old times?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#9$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we can talk this out peacefully, I would rather us not come to blows.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "text": "How could I possibly raise a hand against my little sisters?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "l",
        "name": "avgnew_2014_nian_1#4$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "r",
        "name": "avgnew_2015_dusk_1#5$1",
        "focus": "l"
    },
    {
        "text": "Drop the big talk already. It's two against one. The odds are stacked against you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Nian"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#1$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, we'll just have to see how it all turns out, then.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "charslot",
        "slot": "m",
        "name": "avg_npc_1236_1#4$1"
    },
    {
        "text": "This time, not even the army of that great wild hunt years ago could stop me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ji"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0,
        "block": true
